{"created": "2021-03-26T13:19:14.718019+00:00", "modified": "2021-03-26T13:19:16.174692+00:00", "id": 4639390, "conceptrecid": "4639389", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.4639390", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.4639389", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.4639390", "metadata": {"title": "SDR4IoT BLE & Zigbee RF dataset", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.4639390", "publication_date": "2021-03-26", "description": "<p>This dataset contains raw IQ and demodulated Bluetooth Low Energy and Zigbee traffic collected using USRP N210 SDR hardware in the FED4Fire+ w-iLab.2 testbed in Ghent, in the context of SDR4IoT SME Experiment.</p>\n\n<p>The main goal of the experiment was to collect a dataset of raw signal from IoT 2.4GHz RF protocols and more precisely Bluetooth Low Energy and Zigbee using SDR nodes of the w-iLab.2 testbed.<br>\nThen we exploited this dataset to develop deep learning algorithm for IoT device fingerprinting and localization. This second task has been performed using the VirtualWall/GPULab at IMEC.</p>\n\n<p>The first step aims at building a large dataset of RF and wireless data using the variety of wireless nodes and smartphones available in the w-iLab.2 testbed. We used the 802.15.4/Bluetooth Low Energy sensor nodes, and the smartphone mobile nodes, placed on top of robots, to generate Zigbee and Bluetooth Low Energy traffic, at distinct positions and with a different number of emitters. This traffic has been demodulated and recorded using the SDR nodes equipped with USRP N210 hardware and GNU Radio.</p>\n\n<p>In the second step, this large dataset was shared with the VirtualWall/GPULab infrastructure to be exploited there. We will develop data engineering and deep learning algorithms thanks to the JupyterHub instance. Then, the supervised learning models that we developed were trained and evaluated using the large dataset collected previously in the w-iLab.2 testbed, and taking advantage of the GPU computation resources provided by the VirtualWall/GPULab testbed.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Alexis Duque", "affiliation": "Rtone", "orcid": "0000-0002-0728-4611"}, {"name": "Marc Finet", "affiliation": "Rtone"}, {"name": "Thibaud Vial", "affiliation": "Rtone"}, {"name": "Mathilde Humbert", "affiliation": "Rtone"}], "keywords": ["fed4fire+", "ble", "sdr", "zigbee", "iot", "w-iLab.t", "machine learning"], "version": "1.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Physical object", "type": "physicalobject"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "grants": [{"code": "732638", "internal_id": "10.13039/501100000780::732638", "funder": {"name": "European Commission", "doi": "10.13039/501100000780", "acronym": "EC"}, "title": "Federation for FIRE Plus", "acronym": "Fed4FIREplus", "program": "H2020-EU.2.1.1.", "url": "https://cordis.europa.eu/projects/732638"}], "communities": [{"id": "eu"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "4639389"}}]}}, "title": "SDR4IoT BLE & Zigbee RF dataset", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/4639390", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/4639390?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.4639390", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.4639390", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.4639390", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639389", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/4639389", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.4639389", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.4639389", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:4639390/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:4639390/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/4639390/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/requests"}, "updated": "2021-03-26T13:19:16.174692+00:00", "recid": "4639390", "revision": 1, "files": [{"id": "9ac419b7-f2e0-4cd4-b46a-5758b9d52afc", "key": "experiment_doc.md", "size": 7700, "checksum": "md5:56afa66fdbce618b3f96b0ac81eee0ec", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/files/experiment_doc.md/content"}}, {"id": "a84a67c4-10b5-467f-a16f-20bd1bec142c", "key": "dataset.zip", "size": 78658727, "checksum": "md5:c966c5cbf1243b5a16f59675451de84e", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4639390/files/dataset.zip/content"}}], "swh": {}, "owners": [{"id": "87620"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 840, "unique_downloads": 670, "views": 1807, "unique_views": 1658, "version_downloads": 840, "version_unique_downloads": 670, "version_unique_views": 1657, "version_views": 1806}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}